WEBVTT

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:08.360
Our mission is to gather the Seven Mermaid Princesses and seven pearls to summon forth Aqua Regina-sama.

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:11.410
We're feeling a bit relieved since Karen joined our side,

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:15.700
but Karen's twin sister, Noelle, is still trapped in Gaito's lair.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.410
But we're never, ever going to lose to them!

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:24.310
All right! Today again with our Pichi Pichi Voices, it's Live Start!

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:06.090
Hey, Lucia.

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:09.170
Today on the way home, do you want to go grab something sweet?

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:12.350
Sounds good. How about a chocolate parfait?

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:13.190
Lucia.

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:14.340
What is it, Kaito?

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:16.060
Want to walk home together today?

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:18.240
Eh? Together with you?

00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:20.150
Let's go.

00:02:20.150 --> 00:02:21.020
Yeah...

00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:23.420
See you later, Lucia.

00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:24.700
Sorry, Hanon!

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:28.110
I wonder what happened with Kaito-kun.

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:29.970
He suddenly became so bold.

00:02:29.970 --> 00:02:32.550
Did something happen between the two of them?

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:34.930
They were acting strange during the day of that blizzard, too.

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:36.010
Well, isn't that fine?

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:38.260
They look like they're having a good time.

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:43.470
Why can't Tarou-chan ask me out like that!?

00:02:45.050 --> 00:02:47.190
A Couple's Feelings.

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:53.540
Hey, Kaito.

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:59.900
It's rare that you would ask me to go home with you.

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:01.660
Is that so?

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:02.990
Of course.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:04.670
The weather sure is nice.

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:06.410
It makes the recent blizzard seem like a dream.

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:09.110
Yeah... you're right.

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:17.210
Lucia!

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:20.380
What's the matter? You need to be more careful.

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:22.800
Thanks, Kaito.

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:29.220
What's going on? Kaito seems different from usual.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.300
Thanks, Kaito, for walking me home.

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:37.220
That's it?

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:38.730
What do you mean by "that's it"?

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:41.100
Don't I get a goodbye kiss?

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:44.220
Eh? A goodbye kiss!?

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:45.740
Ah, I...

00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:48.240
Idiot. I was just joking.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:50.720
Geez. Kaito, you bully.

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:51.690
I don't care anymore.

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:52.910
Wait, Lucia.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:53.620
What?

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.390
Are you free tomorrow?

00:03:56.390 --> 00:03:59.410
There's a place I want to go with you.

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:02.520
If you already have plans, you don't have to.

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:04.420
I-I don't have any plans...

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:06.500
It's decided, then.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.540
I'll pick you up before noon.

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:09.260
See ya.

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:11.670
Kaito...

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:19.370
What?

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:21.220
Who are you?

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:21.980
Sorry, sorry.

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:24.920
I took your picture without asking you first.

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:27.710
Your reaction was so genuine, so I took it.

00:04:27.710 --> 00:04:28.940
Are you talking about me?

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:34.370
It was as if you were in despair, and your joy was being tossed about in the ocean.

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:37.160
Sorry to be rude, but who are you'!?

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:37.160
Sorry to be rude, but who are you'!?

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:41.250
I'm sorry about that. I forgot to introduce myself.

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:44.550
Starting today, I'll be staying in Pearl Piari for the next two or three days.

00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:46.970
I'm Kashiwagi. Pleased to meet you.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:55.160
It's my first time seeing such a splendid camera.

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:57.900
Are you a professional photographer?

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:59.670
Yes.

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:01.520
Wow! So cool!

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:04.110
No, it isn't really like that...

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:06.720
Here you are, the tea you ordered.

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:08.010
Thank you.

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:10.220
Lucia, Hanon-chan.

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:12.750
Kashiwagi-san is a customer.

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:16.140
It's getting late, so both of you should hurry and return to your rooms.

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:17.710
Eh. It's still early, isn't it?

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:18.520
No.

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:22.070
You don't have to be so hard on them, Nikora.

00:05:22.070 --> 00:05:25.010
It's rare for us to have a young male customer.

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:27.530
So let them have some leeway.

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:29.880
Geez. Even you're saying that...

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.000
Hey, hey, Kashiwagi-san.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.980
What do you hope to photograph by coming to this town?

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:38.510
I didn't come here for work, but to have some private time.

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:41.390
For some reason, I really wanted to see the sea during winter.

00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:42.400
Liar.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:43.230
Liar.

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:44.690
He's a liar.

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:49.260
Kashiwagi-san is a really romantic person, isn't he?

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:52.010
But, you said you wanted to see the sea during winter.

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:55.060
Did something sad happen to you?

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:56.280
Why do you think that?

00:05:56.900 --> 00:06:02.210
Why... How do I put it... Wouldn't you want to watch the sea when you're sad?

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:05.260
You might be right.

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:07.210
Kashiwagi-san?

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:11.410
Say, Lucia.

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:13.700
Kashiwagi-san is really great, isn't he?

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:16.860
People call that the "glamor of adults".

00:06:16.860 --> 00:06:19.880
Just ignoring it really makes me uneasy.

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:22.830
My maternal instincts just might surface, you know...

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:25.300
That aspect of him makes him a little like Tarou-chan.

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:29.360
In the end, you just wanted to say that. Geez.

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:33.900
Hanon-san will always be like this when she sees a handsome guy.

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:39.160
A crush is fine, but please keep in mind that you are a Mermaid Princess.

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:42.890
I know that already without you having to tell me.

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:47.160
But while we're living on land, it's alright to have some fun, isn't it?

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:50.370
Because someday we'll have to return to the sea.

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:55.590
Someday, I'll have to return to the sea.

00:06:55.590 --> 00:06:57.090
Besides that, Lucia-san.

00:06:57.090 --> 00:06:59.520
You acted like an adult today.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:00.830
R-Really?

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:03.160
Could you be troubled?

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:04.070
You can tell?

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:09.420
Of course. I've lived together with you for a long time.

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:11.360
So, what is it? Are you troubled about Kaito-kun?

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:13.270
You got it...

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.730
She's also thinking about guys, too, huh?

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:20.950
Because Kaito suddenly asked me out on a date tomorrow.

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:21.950
Ehh!?

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:24.160
A date with Kaito!?

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:27.080
Isn't that great?

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:29.110
So why are you feeling down?

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:33.290
Really! Usually, you'd be jumping for joy, like this!

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:36.340
I feel Kaito is different from usual.

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:40.470
Come to think of it, going home together today, then asking you out on a date.

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:43.880
Even for him, he's overly enthusiastic today isn't he?

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:44.900
Right?

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.480
But is that a problem?

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:48.890
No, not really...

00:07:57.350 --> 00:07:59.450
Oh my. Lucia went out this early?

00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:00.650
Yeah.

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:03.520
But she was really quiet.

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:08.530
Usually, she'd rattle on about how she should tie her hair and how she should dress.

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:09.890
That's true.

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:13.660
Lucia's been acting weird since yesterday.

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:18.130
She's finally going on a date with Kaito-kun, I wonder what happened?

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:24.060
This place is...

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:27.720
Is this the place Kaito said he wanted to go with me?

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:33.020
The day you transferred to this school, we met each other for the first time here.

00:08:33.590 --> 00:08:34.230
Yeah.

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:35.270
Let's go in.

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:50.750
Come to think of it, back then, I desperately wanted Kaito to pay more attention to me.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:56.080
Before I knew it, I progressed to holding hands with him.

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:59.840
I should be happy. I should be filled with joy.

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:02.290
Why can't I feel happy?

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:12.390
In this aquarium, this is the place I like the most.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.850
This place... Could it be...

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:19.070
The place where I first kissed Kaito in my mermaid form.

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:24.360
Kaito...

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:28.040
Did Kaito really want to be together with the mermaid me?

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.870
Or is it...

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.440
I wonder why...

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:35.500
...I wanted Kaito to pay more attention to me.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:38.240
I'm so close to him, yet I feel lonely.

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:43.880
What's the matter, Lucia?

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:45.650
It's nothing.

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:57.980
No!

00:09:57.990 --> 00:09:58.930
Lucia...

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:01.340
Sorry, Kaito. I...

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:03.310
Hey, Lucia!

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:16.390
Miharu.

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:19.340
I can't live on without you.

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:24.310
You're the one who said you wouldn't come here or see me again.

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:25.930
That's because...

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:28.380
You said it was painful to be with me.

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:30.710
Kashiwagi-san?

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:32.810
Who's that woman?

00:10:33.260 --> 00:10:35.810
Why? Tell me the reason!

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:40.390
Because the person you like isn't me.

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:41.760
That's what I feel.

00:10:42.550 --> 00:10:43.680
Take care.

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:45.540
Miharu...

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:48.070
The atmosphere feels serious.

00:10:48.070 --> 00:10:49.990
Maybe I shouldn't watch.

00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:54.420
You're from Pearl Piari...

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:56.380
I-I'm sorry!

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:59.880
I... umm... didn't intend to do that... umm...

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:04.000
It's alright. Don't worry about it.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:05.860
You saw my shameful side, huh.

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:07.760
Well, no...

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:16.640
The person I am now is empty, huh.

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:18.100
Eh?

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:21.260
I made her hate me completely.

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:22.920
I don't think that's true.

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:23.380
Eh?

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:25.960
"Miharu-san", was it?

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:29.820
I think she really likes you.

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:36.370
I think that's why she felt depressed, because she thinks that there's someone else in your heart.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:42.310
Umm. I'm sorry.

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:44.170
I've said too much.

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:46.540
Not at all.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.360
Um, Kashiwagi-san.

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:56.680
I'm going back to Pearl Piari first, okay?

00:11:56.680 --> 00:11:59.610
Okay. I want to stay here a little longer and gaze at the sea.

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:00.450
See ya.

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:08.580
This is bad.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:10.300
Did something happen?

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:13.820
I think that guy might have taken a photograph of the two of us.

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:16.170
Oh dear! This is terrible!

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:20.580
If we, two beautiful water demons, are advertised in a magazine, we'll be famous.

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:24.500
And if I get scouted by a director, what should I do!?

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:27.250
No! That's not what I mean!

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:30.150
Anyway, let's capture that guy.

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:31.530
You're right.

00:12:31.530 --> 00:12:33.990
We should have him take more beautiful photos of us.

00:12:33.990 --> 00:12:35.120
Geez...

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.220
You're making my head hurt...

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:43.980
Presented by Wasurenai-Fansubs

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:54.820
Miharu...

00:12:55.560 --> 00:12:59.130
Because the person you like isn't me.

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:00.370
That's what I feel.

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:05.250
I think that's why she felt depressed, because she thinks that there's someone else in your heart.

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:08.550
No, I...

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:10.640
Miharu...

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:13.000
Miharu!

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:15.660
Can I ask you to go back home later?

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:25.010
Before you do that, can you take a better shot of Yuuri?

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:27.190
Yuuri! Now is not the time say such things!

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:28.200
Are you a fool!?

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:30.280
Who are you two?

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:31.870
You don't need to know.

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:34.530
I'm sorry, but we'll have to confiscate that camera of yours.

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:37.080
Confiscate my camera?

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.620
I'm really sorry.

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:40.600
Although we don't bear any grudge against you,

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:47.820
it'll be troublesome if the photos from that camera circulate in human society.

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:49.490
Materialize, water dragon!

00:13:54.010 --> 00:13:56.610
Kashiwagi-san is really slow.

00:13:56.610 --> 00:13:59.060
The meal I made especially for him will get cold.

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:03.450
Lucia, you said that you were with Kashiwagi-san until evening, right?

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:03.940
Yeah.

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:07.760
Did he say anything at that time?

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:10.370
He said he wanted to stay a little longer and gaze at the sea.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:13.740
I hope Kashiwagi will hurry up and come back.

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:18.950
Since it's such a rare chance, I want him to take a sexy photo of me.

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:21.800
Then I'll send it as a present to Tarou-chan.

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:26.030
Hanon. Only you would think of such things now.

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:31.020
Oh? Hippo is also dolling himself up. He wants Kashiwagi-san to take a photo of him, too.

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:32.020
Yes.

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:39.180
I want to capture the results of my hard work on land in a photograph and show it to our north Pacific friends.

00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:45.160
Hippo. That won't work. Everyone would think you're really old-fashioned.

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:47.750
How can that be!?

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:53.380
Putting that aside, we should look for Kashiwagi-san.

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:55.950
The sea can get very breezy at night.

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:57.020
That's true.

00:14:57.020 --> 00:14:59.160
Lucia, can you go take a look?

00:14:59.160 --> 00:14:59.790
Yes.

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:04.900
Kashiwagi-san!

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:06.220
It's time to eat dinner!

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:11.180
I can't find him anywhere.

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:15.050
This is...

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:17.400
...the camera case that Kashiwagi-san carried with him.

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:22.100
Don't tell me that Kashiwagi-san was swept away by the waves...

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:22.860
Eh!?

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:29.120
Kashiwagi-san!

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:31.650
Yuuri, Izul!

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:34.810
We're pretty lucky today.

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:39.250
We weren't looking for Mermaid Princesses, yet three of them appeared!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:42.490
Alright, everyone. How about taking a commemorative photo?

00:15:43.030 --> 00:15:45.160
Isn't that Kashiwagi-san's camera?

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:47.680
Could you two have...

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:49.110
What have you done to him?

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:52.490
He's sleeping inside a cave now.

00:15:52.490 --> 00:15:56.010
We just wanted his camera.

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:59.990
He was down on his luck after seeing my pet, Mitato-tan.

00:15:59.990 --> 00:16:02.310
Geez. That's why I say human males are useless.

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:05.900
Oh my. Even so, there are amazing human males, too.

00:16:06.820 --> 00:16:08.400
None comparable to Gaito-sama.

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:11.380
Izul always speaks of Gaito-sama.

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:15.300
If you say that too much, people will ignore you when you get back.

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:16.370
What did you say!?

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:17.590
Hanon.

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:18.230
Yeah.

00:16:18.690 --> 00:16:19.280
Rina.

00:16:19.280 --> 00:16:19.670
Sure.

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:26.120
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:28.290
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:30.100
Green Pearl Voice!

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:03.140
Who did you say is a pretty girl!?

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:04.890
Say it again, Yuuri!

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:07.320
I didn't say anyone's a pretty girl!

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:14.000
Dammit.

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:16.180
Now's not the time to argue.

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:20.400
To have taken away a photographer's prized camera...

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:22.520
I definitely won't forgive you!

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.940
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:35.050
Love Shower Pitch!

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:38.430
How about an encore?

00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:42.830
We didn't prepare ourselves to fight against you at all.

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:44.390
Yuuri, we're retreating.

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:45.330
What's with you?

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:46.900
I'll just return this thing to you!

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:50.010
The camera is broken.

00:18:50.010 --> 00:18:52.120
I wonder if Kashiwagi-san is alright.

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:53.200
Let's hurry, Lucia.

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:53.530
Yeah.

00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:01.550
It's a great blessing that he doesn't remember anything about the water demons.

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:04.620
But it seems that he caught a cold.

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:09.960
It's dangerous for a human to have fallen unconscious by the sea in the winter.

00:19:11.490 --> 00:19:13.170
He has a really high fever.

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:14.420
Kashiwagi-san.

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:17.000
Miharu...

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:17.850
Don't leave me...

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:21.810
Miharu? Is that his girlfriend's name?

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:24.230
Miharu-san...

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:35.110
I'm sure she's a very important person to him, as he called out her name in his dreams.

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:39.390
If she's by his side, Kashiwagi-san will be able to recover better.

00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:40.670
That's right.

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:45.160
If he has the person he loves by his side when he's sick, he'll be able to calm down.

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:48.850
Miharu...

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:50.080
Kashiwagi-san.

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:54.180
He loves Miharu-san this much...

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:58.580
Oh, I wonder who that is. At a time like this.

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:00.430
I'll go and take a look.

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:06.890
Umm... May I ask if there is a guy named Kashiwagi residing here?

00:20:07.610 --> 00:20:09.350
M-Miharu-san!

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:17.030
Excuse me. You're Miharu-san, right?

00:20:17.030 --> 00:20:18.710
What? Yeah.

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:23.330
Kashiwagi-san has a high fever, and he's been calling out your name over and over in his sleep.

00:20:23.930 --> 00:20:24.620
Eh?

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:30.670
Moreover, his heart became empty after you left him.

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:35.630
That's why, I think that no one lives in his heart right now.

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:40.050
If you return to him, I'm sure this fact will change.

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.040
Geez.

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:46.220
To have gotten such a high fever, and to be compelled to take photographs...

00:20:46.940 --> 00:20:49.730
He really looks like a child who can't take care of himself.

00:20:49.730 --> 00:20:50.690
I can't leave him as he is.

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:56.660
It's cold.

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:57.510
Rina.

00:20:57.510 --> 00:21:00.980
Here, Lucia. I just heated up some milk.

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:04.400
It's warm.

00:21:04.940 --> 00:21:07.620
It's the best to have hot milk in this cold weather.

00:21:08.980 --> 00:21:09.830
Thanks, Rina.

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:12.240
You're welcome.

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:16.350
Hey, Rina. Can I ask you something?

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:16.800
Sure.

00:21:17.400 --> 00:21:25.760
Can a human guy date a girl he doesn't even like? Or... can he even embrace her?

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:27.940
I wonder, too.

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:30.860
At the very least, I don't think Kaito is that kind of person.

00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:38.870
But... although Kaito asked me out for a date today,

00:21:38.870 --> 00:21:44.250
I can feel his heart is still searching for that mermaid in his memories.

00:21:45.890 --> 00:21:48.610
Lucia, how do you feel?

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:52.530
The mermaid of his memories or your real self.

00:21:52.530 --> 00:21:55.250
Which one do you want him to see?

00:21:56.620 --> 00:22:01.170
Geez! If I'd have thought this would happen, I wouldn't have started liking Kaito in the first place.

00:23:51.000 --> 00:23:54.190
Lucia, I have something to tell you.

00:23:54.190 --> 00:23:56.160
I've decided to go to Hawaii.

00:23:56.160 --> 00:23:58.660
Eh? What did you say just now?

00:23:58.660 --> 00:24:01.890
I wanted you be the first one to know this.

00:24:01.890 --> 00:24:08.220
I want you to know that I have to go to Hawaii to find out something for myself.

00:24:08.700 --> 00:24:11.670
Lucia, I know you'll be able to understand.

00:24:11.670 --> 00:24:12.720
Kaito...

00:24:12.720 --> 00:24:15.750
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch:

00:24:15.750 --> 00:24:17.190
Goodbye.

00:24:17.190 --> 00:24:19.230
Goodbye, Kaito.
